    Duplicates a CBOR string into a newly malloc’d buffer. Call with `value`, get `*buffer` and `*buflen`; `next` receives the following item. It first measures length, allocates, then copies. Returns OOM or copy errors; `buflen` includes the NUL byte. Its signature is:
