​ ```
5. `cbor_value_is_float`
​ `cbor_value_is_float` checks whether a `CborValue` currently holds a CBOR float. Use it on an initialized `CborValue` before treating it as a floating-point number. It returns `true` only when `value->type == CborFloatType`, otherwise `false`.
