## Target API Functions

1. `_cbor_value_finish_string_iteration`
​ `_cbor_value_finish_string_iteration()` ends a CBOR indefinite-length string iteration. Use it after consuming the chunks; it skips the final Break byte only when the length is unknown, then advances to the next value via `preparse_next_value()`.
​ Its signature is:
​ ```c
