​ ```
5. `_cbor_value_decode_int64_internal`
​ Internal helper to decode a CBOR integer stored in the iterator’s raw bytes. Use only when `value` is flagged `IntegerValueTooLarge` or is float/double. If `IntegerValueIs64Bit` is set, it reads 64 bits; otherwise 32 bits.
​ Its signature is:
