​ ```
6. `cbor_value_get_int`
​ `cbor_value_get_int` extracts a CBOR integer into an `int`. Use it only when `cbor_value_is_integer(value)` is true. It writes the unsigned magnitude, then negates as CBOR negative integer (`-n-1`) if flagged. Returns `CborNoError`.
​ Its signature is:
