## Target API Functions

1. `_cbor_value_extract_int64_helper`
​ Returns the integer payload from a `CborValue`: if `CborIteratorFlag_IntegerValueTooLarge` is set, it decodes the stored 64-bit value via `_cbor_value_decode_int64_internal`; otherwise it returns `value->extra`. Use it as an internal helper for integer extraction.
