2. `cbor_value_is_half_float`
​ `cbor_value_is_half_float()` is a simple type check. It returns `true` only when `value->type == CborHalfFloatType`, meaning the current CBOR item is a half-precision float. Use it to test a `CborValue` before reading it as a half float; otherwise it returns `false`.
