​ ```
4. `cbor_value_is_double`
​ `cbor_value_is_double()` is a simple type check. Use it on a `CborValue*` to test whether the current item is a CBOR double-precision floating-point number. It returns `true` only when `value->type == CborDoubleType`, otherwise `false`.
