CBOR_INLINE_API bool cbor_value_is_half_float(const CborValue *value);
​ ```
3. `cbor_value_get_half_float_as_float`
​ Converts a CBOR half-float at `value` into a C `float`. Use it with a `CborValue*` pointing to a half-float and a valid `float*` output. It calls `cbor_value_get_half_float`; on success it writes the decoded value and returns `CborNoError`.
​ Its signature is:
​ ```c
